# The environment variables <product> reads, by name only: never put a value in this file or in the repo.
# compose's Config is the only reader, with one exception: the crash hook (crash.rs) runs with nothing wired, so it
# reads HOME for the crashes folder and the names, never the values, of the variables. A line per variable, each with
# what reads it and whether it must be set.

# Where <product>'s home folder (crash records, local state) lives.
# HOME=  (set by the system; never blank it)
# Where outside tools are found; passed to children.
# PATH=  (set by the system; never blank it)
# The locale passed to children, so a tool's output parses the same way.
# LANG=  (set by the system; never blank it)
